# The module runs on Linux (Odoo containers), and this machine has
# core.autocrlf=true at system level, so anything committed would otherwise
# arrive with CRLF. A config file with CRLF breaks parsers that do not expect it.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
